[style name="VisualNovelDialogueStyle"]
audio music "res://assets/music/Bad Ending.wav"

[i]Your attempts at salvaging this night was a complete failure. Not only have you procured little to no candy, you’ve made enemies with the inhabitants of Dark Wood Avenue[/i]

MC: (I can’t stay here any longer… I’m not welcome.)

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-1.png" fade="2.0"]


[i]You find yourself back where it all began, the woods connecting this street to the rest of the town.[/i]

[i]Looking back at the block, you wonder what you’ll tell your friends after this whole escapade[/i]

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-2.png" fade="1.0"]

[i]You think about lying, it’d be an embarrassment if you found creatures from another world only to mess up your only chance at befriending them[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-3.png" fade="1.5"]

[i]You take a deep breath and step into the brush, wetness clings to your costume. [/i]

[background fade="1.0"]
[i]The journey back is longer than last time—strange branches claw and grip onto your fabric, almost like they’re tugging you backwards[/i]

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-4.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]You find your last reserve of strength to push forward and make it to the warmth of light that is the main path[/i]

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-5.png" fade="1.0"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-6.png" fade="1.5"]

[i]A familiar child talks to their parent—One of your friends! You rush over, happy to see a human face,[/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-7.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]...only for them to yelp and scurry backwards from you. [/i]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-8.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]You ask what’s wrong, but only a gurgle escapes from your mouth[/i]

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-9.png" fade="2.0"]
[i]Your blood runs cold and you quickly look down at your hands. A pair of gloves rest upon two tentacles, fingers limply swaying in the wind. You reach up to touch your face to find a slimy texture, wet and alien[/i]

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-9.png" fade="2.5"]
[background fade="2.0"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad-10.png" fade="2.5"]

[i]You’re not welcome in this town[/i]


[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/endings/bad_end.png"]
#[signal arg="return_menu"]